flowchart TB
Services[Product services] --> Live[Process liveness]
Services --> Core[Database and core readiness]
Services --> Model[Separate inference readiness]
Live --> Alert[Configured owner alerts required]
Core --> Alert
Model --> Alert
DB[Separate PostgreSQL databases] --> Backups[Private encrypted backups]
Files[Private object storage] --> Backups
Robot[Robot development history recovery] --> Backups
Backups --> Restore[Isolated integrity authorization and schema restore test]
Restore --> Rollback[Reviewed recovery and rollback acceptance]
